## TL;DR

If you’re in the UK right now, a VPN isn’t just about Netflix. It’s about browsing freely, without feeling watched. [NordVPN](https://ref.nordvpn.com/nHkphsloziK) has been my go-to for years, and it’s proven dependable every time.
